\v 9 \w When Joab| strong="H3097" \w* [saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w that the front| strong="H6440" \w* \w of the battle| strong="H4421" \w* \w was against him before| strong="H6440" \w* \w and behind| strong="H268" \w*, [he chose]{strong=“H977” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [of all the choice]{strong=“H977” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} men \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, and put them [in array]{strong=“H6186” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [against]{strong=“H7125” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w the Syrians| strong="H758" \w*: 
