\v 13 \w And when David| strong="H1732" \w* [had called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [him, he did eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and drink]{strong=“H8354” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* [him; and he made him drunk]{strong=“H7937” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}: \w and at even| strong="H6153" \w* [he went out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to lie]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w on his bed| strong="H4904" \w* \w with the servants| strong="H5650" \w* \w of his lord| strong="H113" \w*, [but went not down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to his house| strong="H1004" \w*. 
