\p
\v 4 \w And when the woman| strong="H802" \w* \w of Tekoah| strong="H8621" \w* [spake]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to the king| strong="H4428" \w*, [she fell]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w on her face| strong="H639" \w* \w to the ground| strong="H776" \w*, [and did obeisance]{strong=“H7812” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”}, [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Help]{strong=“H3467” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”}, \w O king| strong="H4428" \w*.\f + \fr 14:4 \ft Help: Heb. Save \f* 
\v 5 \w And the king| strong="H4428" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto her, What aileth thee? And she answered]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, I am \w indeed| strong="H61" \w* \w a widow| strong="H490" \w* \w woman| strong="H802" \w*, \w and mine husband| strong="H376" \w* [is dead]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 6 \w And thy handmaid| strong="H8198" \w* \w had two| strong="H8147" \w* \w sons| strong="H1121" \w*, \w and they two| strong="H8147" \w* [strove together]{strong=“H5327” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w in the field| strong="H7704" \w*, and there was [none to part]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} [them, but the one]{strong=“H259”} [smote]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the other| strong="H259" \w*, [and slew]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} him.\f + \fr 14:6 \ft none…: Heb. no deliverer between them \f* 
\v 7 [And, behold, the whole family]{strong=“H4940”} [is risen]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w against thine handmaid| strong="H8198" \w*, [and they said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Deliver]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [him that smote]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w his brother| strong="H251" \w*, [that we may kill]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [him, for the life]{strong=“H5315”} \w of his brother| strong="H251" \w* [whom he slew]{strong=“H2026” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; [and we will destroy]{strong=“H8045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [the heir]{strong=“H3423” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [also: and so they shall quench]{strong=“H3518” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w my coal| strong="H1513" \w* [which is left]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [and shall not leave]{strong=“H7604” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w to my husband| strong="H376" \w* neither \w name| strong="H8034" \w* \w nor remainder| strong="H7611" \w* \w upon| strong="H6440" \w* \w the earth| strong="H127" \w*.\f + \fr 14:7 \ft upon…: Heb. upon the face of the earth \f* 
\v 8 \w And the king| strong="H4428" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the woman| strong="H802" \w*, [Go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w to thine house| strong="H1004" \w*, [and I will give charge]{strong=“H6680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} concerning thee. 
\v 9 \w And the woman| strong="H802" \w* \w of Tekoah| strong="H8621" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the king| strong="H4428" \w*, \w My lord| strong="H113" \w*, \w O king| strong="H4428" \w*, \w the iniquity| strong="H5771" \w* be [on me, and on my father’s]{strong=“H1”} \w house| strong="H1004" \w*: \w and the king| strong="H4428" \w* \w and his throne| strong="H3678" \w* be \w guiltless| strong="H5355" \w*. 
\v 10 \w And the king| strong="H4428" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Whosoever saith]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} ought [unto thee, bring]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [him to me, and he shall not touch]{strong=“H5060” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [thee any more]{strong=“H3254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}. 
\v 11 [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [she, I pray thee, let the king]{strong=“H4428”} [remember]{strong=“H2142” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w*, [that thou wouldest not suffer the revengers]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of blood| strong="H1818" \w* [to destroy]{strong=“H7843” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} [any more]{strong=“H7235” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”}, [lest they destroy]{strong=“H8045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w my son| strong="H1121" \w*. [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, As the \sc Lord\sc* \w liveth| strong="H2416" \w*, \w there shall not one hair| strong="H8185" \w* \w of thy son| strong="H1121" \w* [fall]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to the earth| strong="H776" \w*.\f + \fr 14:11 \ft that…: Heb. that the revenger of blood do not multiply to destroy \f* 
\v 12 \w Then the woman| strong="H802" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w Let thine handmaid| strong="H8198" \w*, [I pray thee, speak]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} one \w word| strong="H1697" \w* \w unto my lord| strong="H113" \w* \w the king| strong="H4428" \w*. [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Say on]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”}. 
\v 13 \w And the woman| strong="H802" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Wherefore then hast thou thought]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w such a thing against the people| strong="H5971" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w*? \w for the king| strong="H4428" \w* [doth speak]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8693”} \w this thing| strong="H1697" \w* \w as one which is faulty| strong="H818" \w*, \w in that the king| strong="H4428" \w* [doth not fetch home again]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} [his banished]{strong=“H5080” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}. 
\v 14 [For we must needs]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [die]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, and are \w as water| strong="H4325" \w* [spilt]{strong=“H5064” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w on the ground| strong="H776" \w*, [which cannot be gathered up again]{strong=“H622” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}; \w neither doth God| strong="H430" \w* [respect]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} any \w person| strong="H5315" \w*: [yet doth he devise]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w means| strong="H4284" \w*, [that his banished]{strong=“H5080” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} [be not expelled]{strong=“H5080” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} from him.\f + \fr 14:14 \ft neither…: or, because God hath not taken away his life, he hath also devised means, etc \f* 
\v 15 [Now therefore that I am come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [to speak]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w of this thing| strong="H1697" \w* \w unto my lord| strong="H113" \w* \w the king| strong="H4428" \w*, it is \w because the people| strong="H5971" \w* [have made me afraid]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”}: \w and thy handmaid| strong="H8198" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [I will now speak]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w unto the king| strong="H4428" \w*; \w it may be that the king| strong="H4428" \w* [will perform]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the request| strong="H1697" \w* \w of his handmaid| strong="H519" \w*. 
\v 16 \w For the king| strong="H4428" \w* [will hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [to deliver]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w his handmaid| strong="H519" \w* \w out of the hand| strong="H3709" \w* \w of the man| strong="H376" \w* that would [destroy]{strong=“H8045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w me and my son| strong="H1121" \w* \w together| strong="H3162" \w* \w out of the inheritance| strong="H5159" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w*. 
\v 17 \w Then thine handmaid| strong="H8198" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w The word| strong="H1697" \w* \w of my lord| strong="H113" \w* \w the king| strong="H4428" \w* \w shall now be comfortable| strong="H4496" \w*: \w for as an angel| strong="H4397" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w*, so is \w my lord| strong="H113" \w* \w the king| strong="H4428" \w* [to discern]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w good| strong="H2896" \w* \w and bad| strong="H7451" \w*: therefore the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w* will be with thee.\f + \fr 14:17 \ft comfortable: Heb. for rest \f* \f + \fr 14:17 \ft to discern: Heb. to hear \f* 
\v 18 \w Then the king| strong="H4428" \w* [answered]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the woman| strong="H802" \w*, [Hide]{strong=“H3582” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [not from me, I pray thee, the thing]{strong=“H1697”} [that I shall ask]{strong=“H7592” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [thee. And the woman]{strong=“H802”} [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w Let my lord| strong="H113" \w* \w the king| strong="H4428" \w* [now speak]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}. 
\v 19 \w And the king| strong="H4428" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, Is not \w the hand| strong="H3027" \w* \w of Joab| strong="H3097" \w* [with thee in all this? And the woman]{strong=“H802”} [answered]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, As \w thy soul| strong="H5315" \w* \w liveth| strong="H2416" \w*, \w my lord| strong="H113" \w* \w the king| strong="H4428" \w*, \w none| strong="H376" \w* \w can| strong="H786" \w* [turn to the right hand]{strong=“H3231” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} [or to the left]{strong=“H8041” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w from ought that my lord| strong="H113" \w* \w the king| strong="H4428" \w* [hath spoken]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”}: \w for thy servant| strong="H5650" \w* \w Joab| strong="H3097" \w*, [he bade]{strong=“H6680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [me, and he put]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w all these words| strong="H1697" \w* \w in the mouth| strong="H6310" \w* \w of thine handmaid| strong="H8198" \w*: 
\v 20 \w To| strong="H5668" \w* [fetch about]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w this form| strong="H6440" \w* \w of speech| strong="H1697" \w* \w hath thy servant| strong="H5650" \w* \w Joab| strong="H3097" \w* [done]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w this thing| strong="H1697" \w*: \w and my lord| strong="H113" \w* is \w wise| strong="H2450" \w*, \w according to the wisdom| strong="H2451" \w* \w of an angel| strong="H4397" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w*, [to know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} all things that are \w in the earth| strong="H776" \w*. 
\p
\v 21 \w And the king| strong="H4428" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto Joab| strong="H3097" \w*, [Behold now, I have done]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w this thing| strong="H1697" \w*: [go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [therefore, bring]{strong=“H7725”} \w the young man| strong="H5288" \w* \w Absalom| strong="H53" \w* [again]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”}. 
\v 22 \w And Joab| strong="H3097" \w* [fell]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to the ground| strong="H776" \w* \w on his face| strong="H6440" \w*, [and bowed]{strong=“H7812” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”} [himself, and thanked]{strong=“H1288” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the king| strong="H4428" \w*: \w and Joab| strong="H3097" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w To day| strong="H3117" \w* \w thy servant| strong="H5650" \w* [knoweth]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [that I have found]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w grace| strong="H2580" \w* \w in thy sight| strong="H5869" \w*, \w my lord| strong="H113" \w*, \w O king| strong="H4428" \w*, \w in that the king| strong="H4428" \w* [hath fulfilled]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the request| strong="H1697" \w* \w of his servant| strong="H5650" \w*.\f + \fr 14:22 \ft thanked: Heb. blessed \f* \f + \fr 14:22 \ft his servant: or, thy servant \f* 
\v 23 \w So Joab| strong="H3097" \w* [arose]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and went]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to Geshur| strong="H1650" \w*, [and brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w Absalom| strong="H53" \w* \w to Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*. 
\v 24 \w And the king| strong="H4428" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Let him turn]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w to his own house| strong="H1004" \w*, [and let him not see]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w my face| strong="H6440" \w*. \w So Absalom| strong="H53" \w* [returned]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w to his own house| strong="H1004" \w*, [and saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not the king’s]{strong=“H4428”} \w face| strong="H6440" \w*. 
\p
\v 25 \w But in all Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w there was none| strong="H376" \w* \w to be so much| strong="H3966" \w* [praised ]{strong=“H1984” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w as Absalom| strong="H53" \w* \w for his beauty| strong="H3303" \w*: \w from the sole| strong="H3709" \w* \w of his foot| strong="H7272" \w* \w even to the crown of his head| strong="H6936" \w* \w there was no blemish| strong="H3971" \w* in him.\f + \fr 14:25 \ft But…: Heb. And as Absalom there was not a beautiful man in all Israel to praise greatly \f* 
\v 26 [And when he polled]{strong=“H1548” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w his head| strong="H7218" \w*, ([for it was at every year’s]{strong=“H3117 H3117”} \w end| strong="H7093" \w* [that he polled]{strong=“H1548” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} it: because the hair [was heavy]{strong=“H3513” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [on him, therefore he polled]{strong=“H1548” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [it:) he weighed]{strong=“H8254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the hair| strong="H8181" \w* \w of his head| strong="H7218" \w* \w at two hundred| strong="H3967" \w* \w shekels| strong="H8255" \w* [after the king’s]{strong=“H4428”} \w weight| strong="H68" \w*. 
\v 27 \w And unto Absalom| strong="H53" \w* [there were born]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w three| strong="H7969" \w* \w sons| strong="H1121" \w*, \w and one| strong="H259" \w* \w daughter| strong="H1323" \w*, \w whose name| strong="H8034" \w* was \w Tamar| strong="H8559" \w*: \w she was a woman| strong="H802" \w* \w of a fair| strong="H3303" \w* \w countenance| strong="H4758" \w*. 
\p
\v 28 \w So Absalom| strong="H53" \w* [dwelt]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w two full| strong="H3117" \w* \w years| strong="H8141" \w* \w in Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*, [and saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not the king’s]{strong=“H4428”} \w face| strong="H6440" \w*. 
\v 29 \w Therefore Absalom| strong="H53" \w* [sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w for Joab| strong="H3097" \w*, [to have sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w him to the king| strong="H4428" \w*; [but he would]{strong=“H14” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [to him: and when he sent again]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the second time| strong="H8145" \w*, [he would]{strong=“H14” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}. 
