\v 10 \w And Absalom| strong="H53" \w*, [whom we anointed]{strong=“H4886” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [over us, is dead]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in battle| strong="H4421" \w*. [Now therefore why speak]{strong=“H2790” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} \w ye not a word of bringing| strong="H7725" \w* \w the king| strong="H4428" \w* [back]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”}?\f + \fr 19:10 \ft speak…: Heb. are ye silent? \f* 
\p
